{"articleNo":"112467","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=112467&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014년 8월 졸업사정결과에 따른 수료처리 알림(2013학년도 후기)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.09.01","hit":"4127","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2013학년도 후기(2014년 8월) 졸업사정결과에 따른 수료처리를</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">아래와 같이 알려드립니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 수료처리 조회</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 가</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) 학적자료조회 메뉴로 조회 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 나</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">학적상태, 최근학적변동이 ‘수료생’, ‘일반수료/영구수료’로 표기됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 일반수료 2년 경과 후에는 영구수료로 학적이 변동됨</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong></strong></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><strong>2. </strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>행정사항</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 가</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">수료생은 재학생으로 불인정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 나</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">졸업예정증명서 발급 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">2014. 08. </span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -178.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 178.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 